      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "In the game, players become real miners who go on an exciting adventure
    underground! Your task is to dig the ground, moving the balls deeper and deeper,
    collecting stars and additional balls along the way, and eventually loading them
    into a waiting truck.\r \n\r\n- Digging: Use simple touches to dig the ground
    and create tunnels. The deeper you dig, the more obstacles and puzzles you will
    encounter along the way.\r \n\r\n- Collecting balls: In each level, you will
    have to find and collect balls that will be scattered throughout the underground
    world. Each ball adds points and helps you reach new heights.      "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad5569965d2734880a004e3e3d7d1358, type: 2}
